  "content": "<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/f40thodrj6_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>theresanaiforthat 说每月PV600万，Similarweb显示每月访问量505万。 那么真的可以把Similarweb的访问量当作PV看待了。</div>\n<div>嗯，比如 V2EX 的访问量，就不准确。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/f40thodrj6_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>30分钟</div>\n<div>实际V2EX的月PV是两千多万\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/f40thodrj6_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/f40thodrj6_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>对，这里有UV\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/f40thodrj6_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>之前V2EX有一个广告投放页面，透露了真实数据</div>\n<div>简单理解，可以相乘。 但实际上应该不能直接相乘。</div>\n<div>再注册个账号</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/f40thodrj6_img4.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>toolify.ai 的2月访问量快400万了。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/f40thodrj6_img5.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>这增长曲线好漂亮</div>\n<div>之前也有一个类似的帖子爆了，说我有一堆的点子，要做哪个好\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/f40thodrj6_img6.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/f40thodrj6_img7.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>sora.fm 牛</div>\n<div>卖吗？</div>\n<div>怎么没有找我买</div>\n<div>SoraWebUI.com 已经收到第一个付费订单了</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/f40thodrj6_img8.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><a href=\"https://v2ex.com/t/1021838\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://v2ex.com/t/1021838</a>\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/f40thodrj6_img8.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>别开源</div>\n<div>claude 有个最大的问题是API不好搞，而当初 Gemini Chat 能火是因为 Gemini API 免费。</div>\n<div>所以我不看好 Claude Chat</div>",
